<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 26.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 26.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, March 26 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   26.03.97	  25.03.97     </p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.4672	 6.4196</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3710	 2.3648</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6046	 4.5894</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2427	 3.2577	 </p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5228	 0.5239</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7936	 0.7919</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2963	 0.2956</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8841	 6.8794</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6997	 0.7006</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2983	 1.2968</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
